# Public Google tag, baked into the storefront at build time.
# GA4 measurement ID (G-…), Google tag (GT-…), Google Ads (AW-…),
# or Tag Manager (GTM-…). Leave empty to keep the tag off.
# The script loads only after the visitor accepts analytics
# (or marketing, for an Ads or Tag Manager id).
VITE_GOOGLE_TAG_ID=
